{"msg":"操作成功!","data":{"guideTitle":"搭配讯飞翻译笔操作使用手册","guideId":13,"guideContent":"<div class=\"text-blue mb-32\">说明：</div>\n      <div class=\"mb-32\">\n        (1) 目前支持的学习机型号：X1 Pro、X2\n        Pro、X2、Q10、Z1、T10、Q20、X3 Pro。（学习机个人中心登录的账号和讯飞翻译笔微信公众号号登录的账号需要是同一个手机号码，可在学习机的【生词本】里查看，右上角有“词典笔生词本”入口的设备版本都是支持的）\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mb-32\">(2) 目前只支持翻译笔的生词同步至学习机，不支持学习机上的内容同步到翻译笔。</div>\n      <div class=\"mb-32 text-weight\">1、讯飞翻译笔如何与讯飞学习机进行绑定</div>\n      <div class=\"mb-32\">第一步：首先按住侧边红色按钮进行开机</div>\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_1_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <div class=\"mb-32\">第二步：开机之后可点击“设置”—“关于”—“SN号的二维码”—“使用手机微信进行扫描二维码”</div>\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_2_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_3_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_4_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_5_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <div class=\"mb-32\">第三步：输入手机号码和验证码进行注册绑定</div>\n      <div class=\"mb-32\">注意：此时讯飞翻译笔输入的注册手机号码需要和当前讯飞学习机的注册手机号码保持一致。</div>\n      <div class=\"flexspacebetween mb-32\">\n        <img\n          class=\"img-l\"\n          src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_6_20210825.jpg\"\n          alt=\"\"\n        />\n        <img\n          class=\"img-r\"\n          src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_7_20210825.jpg\"\n          alt=\"\"\n        />\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mb-32 text-weight\">2、讯飞翻译笔如何与讯飞学习机搭配使用</div>\n      <div class=\"mb-32\">第一步：点击“扫描查词”—根据指示操作，拿起笔“使用笔头进行扫描文字”</div>\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_8_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_9_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_10_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_11_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <div class=\"mb-32\">\n        第二步：扫描成功之后点击—右上角“五角星☆”—进行收藏到<span class=\"text-blue\">生词本中</span>\n      </div>\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_12_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <div class=\"mb-32\">\n        第三步：进入【生词本】点击右上角“导出”—“生成微信二维码”—使用手机微信进行扫描即可获取当前扫描单词记录\n      </div>\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_13_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_14_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <div class=\"mb-32 text-weight\">3、如何通过讯飞学习机查询到讯飞翻译笔导出的生词记录</div>\n      <div class=\"mb-32\">\n        (1)\n        X2Pro/X2/Z1/Q10/X1在学习机上找到“英语学习模块”——“记单词“——“生词本”——右上角“词典笔生词”即可获取讯飞翻译笔导出的生词记录。\n      </div>\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_15_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <div class=\"mb-32\">(2) X3 Pro/Q20/T10在学习机主页面点击“生词本”-右上角“词典笔生词”即可获取讯飞翻译笔导出的生词记录。</div>\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_16_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_17_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <img\n        class=\"img\"\n        src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_18_20210825.jpg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n      />\n      <div class=\"mb-32 text-weight\">4、讯飞翻译笔如何退出账号</div>\n      <div class=\"mb-32\">\n        操作步骤：进入“讯飞翻译笔微信公众号”——“个人中心”——点击头像下方“退出”按钮——“确定退出”即可。\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flexspacebetween mb-32\">\n        <img\n          class=\"img-l\"\n          src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_19_20210825.jpg\"\n          alt=\"\"\n        />\n        <img\n          class=\"img-r\"\n          src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_20_20210825.jpg\"\n          alt=\"\"\n        />\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mb-32 text-weight\">5、讯飞翻译笔如何与讯飞学习机进行解除绑定关系</div>\n      <div class=\"mb-32\">\n        操作步骤：进入“讯飞翻译笔微信公众号”——“个人中心”——“我的设备”——“查看设备详情”——“解除绑定”——“确定解除”\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mb-32\">注意：退出讯飞翻译笔账号及解除绑定关系都不影响翻译笔和学习机查看使用记录</div>\n      <div class=\"flexspacebetween mb-32\">\n        <img\n          class=\"img-l\"\n          src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_21_20210825.jpg\"\n          alt=\"\"\n        />\n        <img\n          class=\"img-r\"\n          src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_22_20210825.jpg\"\n          alt=\"\"\n        />\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flexspacebetween mb-32\">\n        <img\n          class=\"img-l\"\n          src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_23_20210825.jpg\"\n          alt=\"\"\n        />\n        <img\n          class=\"img-r\"\n          src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_24_20210825.jpg\"\n          alt=\"\"\n        />\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flexspacebetween mb-32\">\n        <img\n          class=\"img-l\"\n          src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_25_20210825.jpg\"\n          alt=\"\"\n        />\n        <img\n          class=\"img-r\"\n          src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/translationPen/pic_26_20210825.jpg\"\n          alt=\"\"\n        />\n      </div>"},"status":0}